ges/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Generic_Lightning.webp/300px-Generic_Lightning.webp, /w/images/a/a8/Generic_Lightning.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Generic_Lightning.webp/300px-Generic_Lightning.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Generic_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Lightning Absorption</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> that heals the user if they take any lightning damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When this entity is subjected to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span> damage, it takes no damage and instead regains hit points equal to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span> damage dealt. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p>This was likely a passive intended for the <a href=\"/wiki/Shambling_Mound\" title=\"Shambling Mound\">Shambling Mound</a>, as the tabletop version of the creature has an ability identical to the description.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715163058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 530/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4148/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1743/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 780502/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.857      1 -total\n 57.92%   24.245      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 57.07%   23.888      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 55.25%   23.128      1 Template:Ambox\n 41.99%   17.574      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 10.06%    4.209      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.34%    3.911      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.89%    3.723      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.32%    3.484      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  4.52%    1.894      3 Template:IfEmpty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47359-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715163058 and revision id 290012. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}